menu "wireless dap config"
    config USE_WEBSOCKET_DAP
        bool "Enable the websocket dap feature"

    config OTA_SLOT_TRIAL
        bool "Trial build: never mark the slot valid"
        default n
        help
            The image never marks its OTA slot valid, so any reset returns to the image in the
            other slot. A connection to port 5336 that closes with zero bytes restarts the probe.
endmenu
